        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">While her viral lo-fi music video inspires students everywhere to study, a failing Rowan must choose between her make-up exam and a record deal with her band, Light Owls.</Text>
